      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen-Image 2.1 (uncensored) text to image\n\n- **Steps**: 25 is the Comfy-Org default; the official pipeline uses 40-50 for the most detail.\n- **cfg** stays 1: the negative prompt is ignored at 1, and raising cfg doubles the time per step.\n- **Size**: ~1 MP is fastest (1024x1024: ~66 s at 25 steps, ~105 s at 40). Native 2K works but takes ~10 min at 40 steps. Use multiples of 32.\n- Images are saved without the prompt or workflow embedded.\n- **Ratios** from the model card at 4 MP: 1:1 2048x2048, 4:3 2400x1792, 3:2 2528x1696, 16:9 2752x1536 (halve each side for ~1 MP).\n- **Transparent PNG**: \"This is an RGBA image with transparency. ... The image has an alpha channel and a transparent background.\""
      ],
      "title": "Notes",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
